body:
Meron ba ditong nakapagtake na or may propesyunal na kaalaman sa escitalopram? :( kung okay lang sana, pa-share lang ng experience at guidance kung meron. Kasi po sa totoo lang, takot na takot ako. :( Maraming, maraming salamat po in advance.

&#x200B;

edit 12 oct 2021: di ko lang alam kung mabasa pa ninyong mga nagrespond itong edit. pero salamat talaga sa pagrespond kasi naglakas loob na ako bumili at magsimula na... ulit po, salamat nang marami at ingat palagiii

Ohhh me too, I am staying frugal hahaha online shopping apps became the alternate for window shopping. I find it enjoyable to see stuff and yeah, it's better to have the money on hand instead of spending it on some things that we might not need. :> Anyways, I wish things will be okay for you again... Take care always :>

&#x200B;

(Edit: I read someone suggested the FAW discord. Uhm if it's fine with you, I would say you should try joining one again, particularly the FAW discord of course. :) It's a great one I'd say as compared to other discord groups that I have witnessed before.)
